      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE SQUARE PROBLEM\n\nEven a finer square grid keeps two neighbor distances: 4 edge-neighbors at distance d, 4 corner-neighbors at d×1.41.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r1_b3",
      "originalText": "THE SQUARE PROBLEM\n\nEven a finer square grid keeps two neighbor distances: 4 edge-neighbors at distance d, 4 corner-neighbors at d×1.41.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
    },
