      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r2_b4",
      "originalText": "SMOOTH RIPPLE\n\nA price can diffuse outward from a demand hot spot hex by hex, like heat — every step costs the same, any direction.",
